# ==============================================================================
# ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION FOR 100% FREE EMAIL BACKEND
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to '.env.local' and add your credentials.
#
# HOW TO GET A 100% FREE GMAIL APP PASSWORD (Takes 60 seconds):
# 1. Go to your Google Account (myaccount.google.com)
# 2. Go to "Security" -> Enable "2-Step Verification" if not already enabled.
# 3. Search for "App Passwords" in the search bar.
# 4. Create a new App Password named "Portfolio"
# 5. Copy the 16-character generated password (e.g., 'abcd efgh ijkl mnop')
# 6. Paste your Gmail address and the 16-character password below:
# ==============================================================================

# Your Gmail address that will send the notifications
SMTP_USER="your-email@gmail.com"

# The 16-character Google App Password (without spaces)
SMTP_PASS="your16charpassword"

# The email address where you want to receive inquiries (defaults to SMTP_USER)
CONTACT_RECEIVER_EMAIL="your-email@gmail.com"
